// One fold step of the logical-or level (lowest precedence), above
// and/equality. The level's own loop now lives in parse_expr
// (../../core/expr.id): parse_or was called exactly once, as that function's
// last action, and spent too few actions to fill the segment a chain must
// follow -- so it inlined there rather than chaining. The ladder reads
// parse_expr -> parse_and -> parse_rel(equality+relational).

fold_or(int[] pos, int left) {
  advance(pos);
  int right = parse_and(pos);
  int ret_i = node_bin("||", left, right);
} return int ret_i;
